      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ae14b192f26cf1a6d66ba79|full_name}: I think it's difficult to tell who is who just by text in a group photo of three or more people, or in a photo with people in the background. In fact, I am using an app that retrieves the names of everyone in the instance at the moment the photo is taken and puts them in a txt file, but this is not very useful in instances with many people.\nThe file size will be larger, but it will be easier to understand if the name is displayed above the head. (or maybe just separate the nameplates into transparent PNG?)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
